      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orrum%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The historic Williams‑Powell House earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places in 1984, preserving local heritage.",
